# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Interview Coach CLI — environment variables
#
#  Copy this file to `.env` in the same folder, fill in the keys you plan to
#  use, and `chmod 600 .env` so nobody else can read it.
#
#      cp .env.example .env
#      chmod 600 .env
#      $EDITOR .env
#
#  You do NOT need every key — you only need one LLM key + one STT key.
#  Everything else is optional and enables specific features.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


# ─── LLM providers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pick ONE (or more if you want to switch mid-session). At least one is
# required. Every one you set is available in the runtime picker.

# Anthropic — Claude Opus 4.7 / Sonnet 4.6 / Haiku 4.5
#   Get at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#   Recommended default. Sonnet 4.6 is the best cost/quality balance.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI — GPT-5 / GPT-5 mini / GPT-4o
#   Get at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#   Also required for OpenAI-based STT (see below).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# DeepSeek — deepseek-chat (V4) / deepseek-reasoner
#   Get at: https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
#   Cheapest cloud LLM by ~20× vs Claude Haiku. Solid quality.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini — 2.5 Pro / 2.5 Flash
#   Get at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   Free tier available.
GEMINI_API_KEY=


# ─── STT (speech-to-text) providers ────────────────────────────────────────
# Pick ONE. Local Whisper needs no key. All others need a paid or free key.

# Groq — whisper-large-v3-turbo (fastest cloud STT)
#   Get at: https://console.groq.com/keys
#   Free tier is generous. RECOMMENDED for live calls.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Deepgram — nova-3, streaming with speaker diarization
#   Get at: https://console.deepgram.com/
#   Free $200 credit on signup.
DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=

# Note: OpenAI STT (gpt-4o-mini-transcribe) uses OPENAI_API_KEY above.


# ─── Research (Phase 1 feature) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Enables `interview-recorder --research` and the mid-session `b` hotkey.
# All three sources contribute independently; each degrades gracefully if
# its key is missing.

# Tavily — web search (news, blog posts, talks, LinkedIn public info)
#   Get at: https://tavily.com
#   Free tier: 1000 queries/month, then ~$1 per 1000.
TAVILY_API_KEY=

# GitHub — optional token to lift the 60-req/hr anonymous rate limit
# (research falls back to unauthenticated calls if this is empty)
#   Get at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (fine-grained, "public repo" scope)
#   Only needed for heavy research usage.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# (Semantic Scholar has no key required — no env var needed. If it starts
#  rate-limiting during research, you can request an API key separately.)


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Cost tips
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Minimal setup (basically free):
#   - GROQ_API_KEY only (free tier for STT)
#   - GEMINI_API_KEY only (free tier for LLM)
#   → covers full CLI functionality except research
#
# Recommended balanced setup:
#   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (Sonnet 4.6 for quality LLM)
#   - GROQ_API_KEY (fast + free STT)
#   - TAVILY_API_KEY (research)
#   → ~$0.01-0.05 per meaningful conversation
#
# Cheapest paid setup:
#   - DEEPSEEK_API_KEY (deepseek-chat for LLM)
#   - GROQ_API_KEY (STT)
#   - TAVILY_API_KEY (research)
#   → ~$0.001-0.01 per conversation
#
# Security:
#   - Never commit .env to git (it's in .gitignore).
#   - Always `chmod 600 .env` so only your user can read it.
#   - Rotate any key that's ever been pasted into a chat, email, or shared screen.
